{
  "arguments": {
    "query": "vLLM sleep mode level 1 level 2 weights KV cache offload discard"
  },
  "observation": {
    "evidence": [
      {
        "id": "E9d07846dbc1ae1b8d4fbaa19",
        "chunk_id": "d4addd34fafa7cc7adcc46da",
        "parent_id": "61ca270d637f7077753f21a1",
        "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-sleep_mode.md",
        "sha256": "f0316decf7985681413ca5ece1a238725da31e38c6ad228f5461a211e1833b60",
        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-sleep_mode.md#L18-L18",
        "content": "Level 1 sleep will offload the model weights and discard the KV cache.\nThe content of KV cache is forgotten.\nLevel 1 sleep is good for sleeping and waking up the engine to run the same model again.\nThe model weights are backed up in CPU memory.\nPlease make sure there's enough CPU memory to store the model weights.",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
          "commit": "01efc7ef781391e744ed08c3292817a773d654e6",
          "source_type": "documentation"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "Eb5c5286bf7723eb1f7a34287",
        "chunk_id": "0361a5fbcf40ef5bf88af6ec",
        "parent_id": "61ca270d637f7077753f21a1",
        "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-sleep_mode.md",
        "sha256": "f0316decf7985681413ca5ece1a238725da31e38c6ad228f5461a211e1833b60",
        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-sleep_mode.md#L18-L18",
        "content": "Level 2 sleep will discard both the model weights and the KV cache (while the model's buffers are kept in CPU, like rope scaling tensors).\nThe content of both the model weights and KV cache is forgotten.\nLevel 2 sleep is good for sleeping and waking up the engine to run a different model or update the model, where previous model weights are not needed, e.g.\nRLHF weight update.",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
          "commit": "01efc7ef781391e744ed08c3292817a773d654e6",
          "source_type": "documentation"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "E6f352f27a9a752b7ddda2b69",
        "chunk_id": "5b467b156fda2408bc8abfcb",
        "parent_id": "945da38f9869ed99eb465a09",
        "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-sleep_mode.md",
        "sha256": "f0316decf7985681413ca5ece1a238725da31e38c6ad228f5461a211e1833b60",
        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-sleep_mode.md#L33-L39",
        "content": "```python\n# Put the engine to sleep (level=1: offload weights to CPU RAM, discard KV cache)\nllm.sleep(level=1)\n\n# Wake up the engine (restore weights)\nllm.wake_up()\n```",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
          "commit": "01efc7ef781391e744ed08c3292817a773d654e6",
          "source_type": "documentation"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "Ed2911e94060a37799d8e5446",
        "chunk_id": "249f890f1805949626db6e1b",
        "parent_id": "d66b2cd8eec325d1558fabee",
        "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-sleep_mode.md",
        "sha256": "f0316decf7985681413ca5ece1a238725da31e38c6ad228f5461a211e1833b60",
        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-sleep_mode.md#L7-L11",
        "content": "- **Frees GPU memory**: Offloads model weights to CPU RAM and discards KV cache, releasing up to 90%+ of GPU memory for other tasks.\n- **Fast resume**: Quickly wake up the engine and resume inference without full model reload.\n- **API endpoints**: Control sleep/wake_up state via HTTP endpoints or Python API.\n- **Supports distributed workloads**: Works with tensor parallelism, pipeline parallelism, etc.",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
          "commit": "01efc7ef781391e744ed08c3292817a773d654e6",
          "source_type": "documentation"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "Efbdf670dbe060d708ee523e7",
        "chunk_id": "09c2e6a85e258a6450cf43e1",
        "parent_id": "bbe54b1cb37f224150fb3031",
        "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-sleep_mode.md",
        "sha256": "f0316decf7985681413ca5ece1a238725da31e38c6ad228f5461a211e1833b60",
        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-sleep_mode.md#L3-L3",
        "content": "vLLM's Sleep Mode allows you to temporarily release most GPU memory used by a model, including model weights and KV cache, without stopping the server or unloading the Docker container. This is especially useful for RLHF, training, or cost-saving scenarios where GPU resources need to be freed between inference workloads.",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
          "commit": "01efc7ef781391e744ed08c3292817a773d654e6",
          "source_type": "documentation"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "E4d3c6bf2ad0b60a0eb6d3265",
        "chunk_id": "c6a72f8e94186c6eb7d237d4",
        "parent_id": "d66b2cd8eec325d1558fabee",
        "source": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-sleep_mode.md",
        "sha256": "f0316decf7985681413ca5ece1a238725da31e38c6ad228f5461a211e1833b60",
        "locator": "/Users/jennyma/Projects/InfraAgent/evals/agent-e2e-v1/corpus/vllm-sleep_mode.md#L7-L11",
        "content": "- **Fine-grained control**: Optionally wake up only model weights or KV cache to avoid OOM during weight updates.",
        "truncated": false,
        "metadata": {
          "release": "v0.10.2",
          "commit": "01efc7ef781391e744ed08c3292817a773d654e6",
          "source_type": "documentation"
        }
      }
